{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1160693-birth-questions","id":1160693,"title":"Birth Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-19T16:44:55-08:00","id":1160693,"title":"Birth Questions","content":"<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"><span style=\"font-family:Whitney\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">[COLOR=rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.701961)]<span style=\"font-family:inherit\">so in the books the High King h</span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> So it's stated that High Kind David has a sister. Is this his human sister that also just happens to be a Changeling? Or His Fae sister that has reincarnated in another human body unrelated to David? And somewhere else it talks about them having children. How does all that work out?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"><span style=\"font-family:Whitney\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">[COLOR=rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.701961)]<span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Is this a human sister that's also a changeling or his fairie sister that reincarnated in an</span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"><span style=\"font-family:Whitney\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">[COLOR=rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.701961)]<span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Also there seems to be some hints of changelings having children. But what </span></span></span></span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4045,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4045-princeofcincinnati","user":"princeofcincinnati","date":". 11-19-2017, 07:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactio